WEBVTT

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.250
Good.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:24.500
Mr. Ryoma, what are you doing with those?

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.120
The metal slime...

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:33.080
...as you see, is very hard, so I'm sure
it's resistant to physical attacks.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:37.120
I want to see if it's affected by poisons.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.580
I see!

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.950
I'm not going to make it
drink poison, of course.

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:44.870
I'll just show it, and see how it reacts...

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:48.410
Starting with poison from the poison slime...

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:52.830
No problem with poison.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:56.950
How about sticky slime solution...?

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:02.700
Fine again. Next, acid slime acid...

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.660
It seems to be afraid of acid.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:10.290
Perhaps it melts in acid because it's a metal.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:15.330
Okay, experiments are done. Sorry to scare you.

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:20.870
It's like clay!

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:22.830
Right!

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:35.000
Hey, Ryo-mya!

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.660
Ryo-mya!

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.870
Ryoma!

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:41.370
Are you ready? Let's go!

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:43.290
Let's go!

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.620
Oh, right!

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:47.450
Coming right away!

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:51.540
Thank you.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:54.580
Good luck hunting those monsters!

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:55.700
Yes.

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.700
I'm going off now!

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:02.870
Good luck, and be careful!

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:37.950
"Episode 6"
"Monster Hunting, with the Slimes"

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:44.450
The monsters found in the abandoned
mine shafts are the cave mantis...

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.450
This is the cave mantis.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:47.870
...the cave bat...

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:50.040
This is the cave bat.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.200
...and the small rat.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.790
This is the small rat.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:04:00.450
None of them, on their own, are tough monsters,
but we expect a large horde.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:04.290
Don't let your guard down as you hunt them.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:10.200
I see, you've been promoted to rank F.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:15.790
Yes, the pit toilet cleaning job was
enough to qualify me for the promotion.

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:18.200
Great work, Ryo-mya!

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:21.160
Why do <i>you </i>have the smug face?

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:26.290
If you do well on this monster hunt,
I'm sure you'll go up to rank E right away.

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.830
Great work, Ryo-mya!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:36.410
We will take this route.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:39.450
Be careful, Asagi, Leipin.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:43.200
Negligence is not a part of my dictionary.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:46.500
Good luck to us both, Ryoma.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:48.790
Yes, let's do our best!

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:56.410
How many slimes do you have now, Ryoma?

00:04:56.410 --> 00:05:00.660
728 sticky slimes,

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:04.000
323 poison slimes,

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.370
211 acid slimes,

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:11.160
3,033 scavenger slimes,

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:13.410
11 cleaner slimes,

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.370
two healing slimes,

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.290
one metal slime,

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.200
and one ordinary slime.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:21.910
That's a total of 4,310 slimes.

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:23.580
That's an astonishing number.

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.040
That's too much...

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:28.200
I didn't notice that they grew so much.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:31.040
But to control so many slimes...

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:33.330
Great work, Ryo-mya!

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:36.830
Again, why do <i>you </i>have the smug face?

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:39.830
By the way, Ryoma.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:42.040
Yes, Miss Welanna.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:45.200
What weapons can you use?

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:50.040
I mostly fight with a bow, but I can also
use daggers, or fight unarmed.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:52.330
I can also use some attack magic.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:56.500
Okay, can you concentrate on
flying monsters, using your attack magic?

00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:00.870
You're the only one on this team
that can use attack magics.

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:02.370
I understand.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:08.540
I can use some, but we beastkin
have low magic energy.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:13.540
I can't use attack magic, but you can
count on me for healing magic!

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:17.080
Here they come!

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:24.580
Let's go! Let the monster hunt begin!

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:25.790
Yeah!

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:35.120
No challenge at all.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:40.000
You won't find a challenge
with cave mantises and small rats.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:46.620
We'd be in trouble if loads of monsters
that can give Jeff a challenge came out!

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:51.000
Enough chit chat, let's go.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.660
Sure, sure.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.580
What is it?

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:04.620
There's a group of cave bats up ahead.

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:06.870
They're covering the ceiling.

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:08.660
You noticed, too?

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:13.700
I spent three years in the forest,
so I'm pretty sensitive to these signs.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:19.330
Cave bats come in huge numbers. What a bother.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:21.910
If only there was a way to
take them all out at once...

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:26.290
In that case, may I conduct an experiment?

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:27.450
An experiment?

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:31.290
If this works, I might be able to
take them all down at once.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:32.910
How so?

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:36.080
I will use a magic called "Sound Bomb."

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:40.540
Sound Bomb? Never heard of it.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.450
What is it like?

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:44.790
I should just show you rather than explain.

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:48.450
First I'll cover you all
with a Soundproof Barrier.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:49.830
Soundproof Barrier.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.160
Hmm?

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:57.450
A barrier magic. What would this...

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:58.910
And...

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.830
Sound Bomb!

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:12.330
Good.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:14.500
Let's go.

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:23.330
I think it worked.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:27.250
I see, you knocked them out
with a huge blast of sound.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:29.700
Sound Bomb, aptly named.

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:30.950
Impressive.

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:33.200
Great work, Ryoma!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:36.620
Again, why... Never mind.

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:41.290
Right! Big sticky slime, unshrink!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.830
Whoa! They're huge!

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.290
Wow!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:49.160
How imposing...

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:50.700
Unjoin!

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.870
What an appetite.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.370
Are they going to grow in number again?

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:04.580
And thus, our monster hunt went on smoothly.

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:09.080
Around midday, we headed
out of the mines to take a break.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:12.500
Ah, the fresh taste of freedom.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.410
What are you talking about?

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:19.580
What's going on?

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:23.620
Everyone, please gather around! It's urgent!

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:29.120
One of the parties encountered
a pack of goblins deep in the mines.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:31.160
Some were injured.

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.540
Goblins...

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.500
This is a goblin.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:41.290
Judging from intel, there may be
a large goblin village with over 500 goblins.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.500
That's troublesome.

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.040
We have to crush them fast,
or they'll grow in number.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:47.370
What?!

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:51.700
That's why we're starting an operation
to eliminate the goblins!

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:58.040
The goblin village was discovered
deep in the mines.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.870
As the first step for the attack on the goblins,

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:06.830
adventurers were posted in each
mine shaft to block the goblins' escape.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.950
The operation begins.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.040
We dug a deep trench using earth magic

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:50.120
and filled it with acid slimes and
their acid to melt the goblins quickly.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.660
Those that got over the trench

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:56.450
were shot down with attack magic and
arrows laced with poison slime poisons.

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:58.830
There's more coming!

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.370
Yeah!

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:08.580
And thus, all of the adventurers worked
together to face off against the goblins.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:12.000
There's much more than 500!

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.790
Well over 1,000, for sure.

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:17.000
It's unending!

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:20.620
The arrows...

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:25.120
There's too many of them!
We're running out of arrows!

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.370
How many of them are there?!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:33.580
The acid slimes aren't digesting fast enough...

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:40.330
I'll patch you up right away.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:45.120
Ah! This must be the
healing slime I heard about!

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:50.080
My history as a monster researcher is long,
but this is the first time I've seen this.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:55.580
Oops, I'd better carry you out first. Warp!

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:05.160
There's way too many of them!

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.580
This is...

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:08.080
Not good...

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.080
Everyone!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.040
I'll hold the goblins off!

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:13.200
Ryoma?!

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:14.830
Everyone, come!

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:21.830
I'm using Sound Bomb!

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:24.830
Everyone, back off!

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:26.830
It's gonna get loud!

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.120
Hurry!

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.200
You, too, Guild Master!

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:30.410
R-Right!

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:33.750
Everyone, cover your ears!

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:42.410
Soundproof Barrier...

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.000
Sound Bomb!

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:04.870
Show those goblins what you've trained for!

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:17.250
--Ryo-mya! Ryo-mya! Ryo-mya!
--Slimes using weapons...?

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.910
--Ryo-mya! Ryo-mya! Ryo-mya!
--That boy...

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:21.040
Everyone, now!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:34.120
You guys, follow Ryoma's lead!

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.540
Yeah!

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:39.790
The slimes...

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.500
Thanks!

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:09.500
Is that all of them?

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.950
There must have been about 2,000.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:16.200
You're going to have to pay us well for this.

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:18.080
Yeah, I know.

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:35.830
Oh, that's...

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:37.580
Is that the leader?

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:39.870
A goblin commander!

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:41.700
Not just that...

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:45.500
Hobgoblins.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.750
So many more...?

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.200
Commander...

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.910
Let's go, slimes!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:07.910
I wonder if it can withstand
the weight of an elephant...?

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:11.540
--Hey there. You're gonna get fat.
--It's still eating!

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:14.250
Oh, enough of this roundness!

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:18.290
I guess that about does it for the cleanup...

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:25.250
It doesn't seem like
any of the goblins got away.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:28.330
All of the injured have been transported out.

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:31.370
Good, we should get going, too.

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:34.790
Oh, one moment please.

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:37.870
Could you all gather around me?

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:38.750
What?

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:39.910
What is it?

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.750
Cleaner slimes, you're up.

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:47.620
Do it.

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:55.330
That tickles!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.120
This...

00:15:58.120 --> 00:15:59.910
The goblin grime...?

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:02.870
It's getting cleaned right off...

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:05.330
Seriously...?!

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:09.700
Goblin grime is supposed to be
the hardest muck to clean off in the world...

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:13.830
I was going to throw out these clothes
since the grime and smell won't come off...

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:15.500
I don't believe this...

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.950
I didn't know such a slime exists!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:20.950
I am astounded.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:27.410
Great work, Ryo-mya! You could make
a fortune in the laundry business!

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:36.250
Oh... Astounding!

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.410
What is it, Mr. Leipin?

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:44.620
Ryoma's healing slimes
have begun casting High Heal.

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:49.410
High Heal?! That's an unexpected evolution.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:53.540
Yes. Perhaps it is because
they've used Heal many times.

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:56.330
It's making the medical procedure
go much faster. Extremely helpful.

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:57.790
I'm glad to hear...?!

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.950
Thank you, you saved us!

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:05.870
Are you controlling all of
those slimes?! I'm astonished!

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:09.500
I'm not sure we would have won
if it wasn't for your slimes!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:13.750
Your healing slimes cured
my brother! You have my thanks!

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:18.370
Oh, yes, um, I'm glad you're all okay, too.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:25.000
He looks like just a boy, but he's
a full-fledged adventurer for sure.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.790
Yeah.

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:29.200
Good work, everyone!

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:34.410
The goblin commander made this
a bigger job than expected,

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:37.830
so of course, expect a big raise, all of you!

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:43.080
Truly, truly great work. Please rest well!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:56.290
Do the healing slimes eat like the other slimes?

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:58.000
They only drink water.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.200
Oh, is that so?

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.830
How do they survive on just water?

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:08.500
Photosynthesis. They make their
own nutrients by absorbing light.

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:15.290
I see, like plants. So there are
monsters like that as well...

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:17.700
Are healing slimes strong?

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:21.910
They're very weak. They would probably
lose against normal slimes.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.950
That's quite weak...

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:27.700
I think that's why healing slimes are so rare.

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:31.290
Even when they do appear,
they have a very low chance of survival.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.660
I see.

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:37.540
I'm not well-versed in taming magic, but...

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:43.120
I have heard that controlling the monsters
becomes harder as their numbers increase.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:47.410
Ryoma, you control an
astonishing number of slimes.

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:50.200
Does that not raise your evaluation
at the Tamer's Guild?

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:54.540
I've only registered very recently,
so I have no recorded achievements.

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:58.540
Also, I've been told that slimes aren't
evaluated well at the Tamer's Guild.

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:05.450
Many hold the preconception
that slimes are useless and worthless.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:11.830
Really? Even with my total lack of knowledge,
I can tell Ryoma's awesome.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:15.870
Perhaps if more people saw things
without bias, like you do,

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:19.290
he will receive the praise he deserves.

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:32.290
I can take over. Mr. Jeff, please take a break.

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:36.080
Don't worry, you take a break.

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:38.910
It had to have been tough today, even for you.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:45.000
Yes, I didn't think there would be
quite so many goblins.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:50.290
Yeah. Normally a job like that
requires much more preparation.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.910
I see.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:56.410
I'll drive a while longer.
Go ahead and get some sleep.

00:19:56.410 --> 00:19:59.000
Yes, thank you.

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:06.410
I'm so glad I came to this world.

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.870
Everyone is so nice to me.

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:11.620
It's not like Earth at all.

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:17.870
But I haven't changed at all
since my days on Earth.

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:25.160
I was tired of dealing with people on Earth,
so I hid in the forest for so long.

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:32.910
If I didn't meet the Jamil family,
I might never have left that forest.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:38.000
They let me travel with them,
gave me food and shelter,

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.540
and gave me all the help I could possibly need.

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:45.000
It was so comfortable, and I...

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:47.330
Am I relying on them too much?

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:53.120
Is it right for me to keep depending on
the ducal family like this...?

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:58.080
Ryo-mya, see you!

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:02.330
Thanks, everyone. Good night!

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:08.500
You'd make a fortune running a laundry service!

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.620
Laundry service...

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:22.000
Two thousand goblins?!

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:24.330
A-Are you all right?!

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:30.500
Yes, thankfully. Nobody died,
and we were able to eliminate them.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:32.410
I'm glad...

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:36.870
I think that took care of
most of the monsters in the mines.

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:40.250
Mr. Ryoma, thank you for your hard work.

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:42.250
Also...

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:46.250
There's one more thing
I want to discuss with you.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:51.500
Mr. Ryoma? What is it all of a sudden?

00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:52.540
Elia.

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:56.120
What is it? Please let us hear.

00:21:56.910 --> 00:22:02.200
I've decided what to do from here on.

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:08.330
You have helped me so much,
I can't thank you enough.

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:10.330
But...

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:16.000
I'd like to separate from you now,
and be able to support myself.
